 * Driftless Workforce Group: website forms backend and private inbox.
 *
 * Lives inside a Google Sheet you own (Extensions > Apps Script). Website forms post here;
 * each submission becomes a row on its own tab, resumes go to a private Drive folder,
 * and you get an email for every new submission. Only you can open the inbox.
 * Setup steps are in SETUP.md. This file is generated by build.py; edit the template.
 */
